+From 558b8fb9ad1ff93cfa2c106094443b2907ddd85d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: oh5uosnvh <oh5uosnvh@users.noreply.github.com>
+Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 13:13:55 +0800
+Subject: [PATCH 8/8] =?UTF-8?q?feat(models):=20=E5=8E=82=E5=95=86=E5=9B=BE?=
+ =?UTF-8?q?=E6=A0=87=20/=20=E6=B5=8B=E6=B4=BB=E6=94=B9=E4=B8=A4=E6=AD=A5?=
+ =?UTF-8?q?=20/=20=E9=9D=A2=E6=9D=BF=E6=8D=A2=E6=8E=89=E5=8F=AF=E6=8B=96?=
